{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EaT3a74T2WL41mqJoZTwhd","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information needed. Let me compile the findings.\n\n## Summary: Task 5269 Stitch Prompt and Requirements\n\nI've found and reviewed the stitch prompt and requirements files for task 5269. Here are the key findings:\n\n### Task Overview\n**Title:** [stitch] cmd/expand: implement srd024-expand R2.1-R2.4\n\n**Deliverable Type:** Code\n\n### Key Requirements\nThe task is to implement requirements R2.1-R2.4 of the srd024-expand specification. According to the requirements.yaml:\n- R2.1: Status = complete, Issue #5268\n- R2.2: Status = complete, Issue #5268\n- R2.3: Status = complete, Issue #5268\n- R2.4: Status = complete, Issue #5268\n\n(Note: These are marked as \"complete\" in the requirements.yaml, likely indicating the prior tasks from issue 5268 have been completed)\n\n### Required Reading\n1. `docs/specs/software-requirements/srd024-expand.yaml` (requirements R2.1-R2.4)\n2. `cmd/expand/main.go` (existing implementation from R1.1-R1.4)\n3. `cmd/expand/expand_test.go` (existing differential tests from R1.1-R1.4)\n4. `pkg/testutils/` (differential testing framework)\n5. `pkg/sys/sigpipe.go` (SIGPIPE handling)\n\n### Files to Modify\n1. `cmd/expand/main.go` - Add functionality for srd024-expand R2.1-R2.4\n2. `cmd/expand/expand_test.go` - Add differential test cases for R2.1-R2.4\n\n### Design Decisions\n1. Use `pkg/testutils.RunDiffTests` to compare output against the gexpand reference binary installed via Homebrew\n2. Call `exec.LookPath(\"gexpand\")` at the start of TestDiff and `t.Skip` if the reference binary is not found\n3. Ensure main() calls `pkg/sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler()` before any stdout writes\n4. Set LC_ALL=C in differential test environment to ensure consistent behavior between Go and GNU implementations\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- AC1-AC4: Implement srd024-expand requirements R2.1-R2.4, each with at least one differential test case\n- AC5: `go build ./cmd/expand/` compiles without errors\n- AC6: `go test ./cmd/expand/ -count=1` passes (or skips gracefully if gexpand is not installed)\n\n### Files Location\n- Stitch prompt: `/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5269/.cobbler/history/2026-05-15-10-06-13-stitch-prompt.yaml`\n- Requirements: `/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5269/.cobbler/requirements.yaml`"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"566fb101-3845-4dae-83a6-ea469666fae6","uuid":"fa1e50a0-ec05-479f-9a99-cc0c66a0fb98","timestamp":"2026-05-15T14:17:10.671Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"I need to find the stitch prompt for task 5269 to understand what requirements need to be implemented. Look in .cobbler/history/ for the most recent stitch-prompt.yaml file. Also read .cobbler/requirements.yaml to understand what requirements are assigned to this task. The working directory is /private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5269\n\nRead the most recent stitch prompt file and the requirements.yaml file.","agentId":"ae4c829447aaba2d6","agentType":"Explore","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information needed. Let me compile the findings.\n\n## Summary: Task 5269 Stitch Prompt and Requirements\n\nI've found and reviewed the stitch prompt and requirements files for task 5269. Here are the key findings:\n\n### Task Overview\n**Title:** [stitch] cmd/expand: implement srd024-expand R2.1-R2.4\n\n**Deliverable Type:** Code\n\n### Key Requirements\nThe task is to implement requirements R2.1-R2.4 of the srd024-expand specification. According to the requirements.yaml:\n- R2.1: Status = complete, Issue #5268\n- R2.2: Status = complete, Issue #5268\n- R2.3: Status = complete, Issue #5268\n- R2.4: Status = complete, Issue #5268\n\n(Note: These are marked as \"complete\" in the requirements.yaml, likely indicating the prior tasks from issue 5268 have been completed)\n\n### Required Reading\n1. `docs/specs/software-requirements/srd024-expand.yaml` (requirements R2.1-R2.4)\n2. `cmd/expand/main.go` (existing implementation from R1.1-R1.4)\n3. `cmd/expand/expand_test.go` (existing differential tests from R1.1-R1.4)\n4. `pkg/testutils/` (differential testing framework)\n5. `pkg/sys/sigpipe.go` (SIGPIPE handling)\n\n### Files to Modify\n1. `cmd/expand/main.go` - Add functionality for srd024-expand R2.1-R2.4\n2. `cmd/expand/expand_test.go` - Add differential test cases for R2.1-R2.4\n\n### Design Decisions\n1. Use `pkg/testutils.RunDiffTests` to compare output against the gexpand reference binary installed via Homebrew\n2. Call `exec.LookPath(\"gexpand\")` at the start of TestDiff and `t.Skip` if the reference binary is not found\n3. Ensure main() calls `pkg/sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler()` before any stdout writes\n4. Set LC_ALL=C in differential test environment to ensure consistent behavior between Go and GNU implementations\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- AC1-AC4: Implement srd024-expand requirements R2.1-R2.4, each with at least one differential test case\n- AC5: `go build ./cmd/expand/` compiles without errors\n- AC6: `go test ./cmd/expand/ -count=1` passes (or skips gracefully if gexpand is not installed)\n\n### Files Location\n- Stitch prompt: `/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5269/.cobbler/history/2026-05-15-10-06-13-stitch-prompt.yaml`\n- Requirements: `/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5269/.cobbler/requirements.yaml`"}],"totalDurationMs":70589,"totalTokens":45934,"totalToolUseCount":29,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1152,"cache_read_input_tokens":44013,"output_tokens":769,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,